-- title:
--   Original BV stopped compensated jump and HJB signed expectation with cap source condition derived
-- statement:
--   Source exact original BV signed compensation under an interior compact localisation band. The cap constraint at each predictable stopped source point follows from its membership in the widened interior band, so all integrability, compensated mean zero and nonpositive discounted generator expectation are derived without an independent source cap hypothesis, L1, expectation or martingale premise.
-- source:
--   The predictable source reserve belongs to a compact interval contained in the strictly positive below-cap region, automatically providing the cap condition. Proved original compact C1 derivative/value estimates and source compensated signed mean theorem give the desired separate expectation conclusions.

